  "content_id": "16136149",
  "title": "XRP DEX – Exchange Integration in Edge Wallet",
  "description": "Type: Decentralized Exchange (DEX) Does not have limits or require Know Your Customer (KYC)\nOverview: The XRP Ledger includes a built-in d...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Type:</b> Decentralized Exchange (DEX) Does not have limits or require Know Your Customer (KYC)</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Overview:</b> The XRP Ledger includes a built-in decentralized exchange (XRP DEX), enabling native asset trading on the XRPL network without wrapping. It supports limit orders and direct swaps of XRPL assets.</p><h1 id=\"h_01JSFPE3DXSCHA6HE12GFRE2DF\">How to Manage Exchange Settings in Edge</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">To access your exchange settings in Edge Wallet:</p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap the <b>three lines</b> in the upper right-hand corner</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap on <b>Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap <b>Exchange Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Here, you can turn exchange partners <b>on or off</b>, and customize your preferences. When multiple exchanges can fill an order, you can also choose to automatically select the best price or prioritize a preferred exchange.</p></li></ol>",
